3ZGfzIQ7kNvwFrrFhz&_nc_oc=AdnssiavM7hN4l0F6ce6SscjK19e09X0StnZrltHCF-Nx4hy163VouLkNth-86ns6WE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs-1Nk-naO_iUHtet9hePNasrpR5KUzJmYfNGawUiA9bA&oe=699EFDF6"}, {"file_name": "asset 05 (meta).png", "id": "1297663184758466", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974649_1297663188091799_5190988622455255319_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tw6sCUF72xEQ7kNvwFS13lW&_nc_oc=AdkE-h58SihEINOb5Dz0dpAb62fDgjQ40j4O1q298L3XWBPkMDerA5Hu7pL_0-Yn6AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftJpSTKVbbDRbjllMWFnZkjNwYpU6zA-zO1s_bv3j0P6A&oe=699EEC7D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rising Tides: Miami's Future", "keywords": ["flooding", "climate", "change", "resilience", "miami"], "long_description": "Rising Tides: Miami\u2019s Future is an immersive Meta Quest experience that puts you at the center of Miami\u2019s battle against hurricanes, flooding, and sea-level rise\u2014and the innovative solutions that can help protect it.\n\nExplore Little Havana, Brickell, and Virginia Key using interactive 3D models, aerial views, and real-world photorealistic flooding simulations. Witness firsthand how extreme weather threatens homes, businesses, and infrastructure while discovering flood barriers, home elevation, seawalls, and nature-based defenses that can help safeguard the city.\n\nFeel the force of hurricane winds and storm surges as you navigate through Miami\u2019s most vulnerable neighborhoods. Through cutting-edge VR technology, experience different flooding scenarios and see how engineering and community-driven strategies can build a more resilient future.", "short_description": "Rising Tides: Miami\u2019s Future is an immersive Meta Quest experience exploring Miami\u2019s fight against hurricanes, flooding, and sea-level rise. Visit Little Havana, Brickell, and Virginia Key to witness the impact and discover real-world solutions."}]}, "deve